# PDD Plan — skill-source-of-truth-commercial-spec-engine

## Status
Approved for TDD implementation.

## Goal
Make `.pi/skills/renovacion/` the source of truth, remove root duplicate runtime files, and upgrade the skill-local spec engine to select commercial extractor models by explicit area usage category.

## Inputs Read
- `pdd/skill-source-of-truth-commercial-spec-engine/requirements`
- `pdd/skill-source-of-truth-commercial-spec-engine/explore-cleanup`
- `pdd/skill-source-of-truth-commercial-spec-engine/explore-spec-engine`
- `pdd/skill-source-of-truth-commercial-spec-engine/explore-commercial-catalog-research`

## Approved Decisions Captured
- `.pi/skills/renovacion/` is source of truth.
- Delete duplicate/non-used root runtime files.
- Preserve `.pi/skills/renovacion/**`, `README.md`, `docs/superpowers/**`, `pdd/**`, `.gitignore`.
- Preserve `.pi/skills/renovacion/proyectos/[id]/`.
- Add required `areas[].extractor_type`.
- Enum values: `sencillo`, `ducteable`.
- Mixed served area types resolve equipment category to `ducteable`.
- Category is usage type, not inferred from capacity.
- Capacity selects model only after exact category filter.
- Catalog is local JSON, source-backed, no runtime web lookup.
- Use two local category images.
- Include source/provenance fields.

